[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-OBJ-15
TITLE: Dedicated Publication Pages
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website should have pages for each GSSC publication.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Readers should be able to open each GSSC publication on its own page. Some legacy publications are only a direct file or an external link, and those should gain a page as well.
<<<
OWNER: Customer
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-1
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

